{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bento Story is a cozy sandbox game where you become a bento-making content creator to gain reputation and popularity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bento Creation Sandbox</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange rice, proteins, veggies, and cute decorations into personalized bento boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingredient Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook rice, cut veggies, or shape eggs into cute characters before arranging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new ingredients, cute containers, and background sets as your reputation grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Creator Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap photos of your bento boxes with adjustable camera angles, filters, and add various cute stickers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a wholesome narrative about your journey from small hobbyist to beloved bento influencer.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047790?t=1758858410","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047790/5ae72bf079da4afedd0c565a4926d1591ba66138/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758858410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047790/0e2449a1001d8921f647761bf234a4155b4c4ec8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758858410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047790/0e2449a1001d8921f647761bf234a4155b4c4ec8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758858410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"descript